  "headline_finding": "RO3's exact subgroup was independently reconstructed and verified to reproduce EXP-MONO-c819ba's own archived exact values before any further compute. Both known-positive cells (h=N/2, h=N/4) landed exactly at the permutation-test floor (1/20001) on both statistics, confirming a genuine, maximally-extreme outlier. Despite this, none of the four Fisher-combined mixed-panel results (S1-S4) rejected at alpha=0.05 (p in [0.47, 0.52]) -- the falsification_criterion(c) sensitivity_gap_confirmed outcome. Independent verification shows this is consistent with Fisher's combined-probability test's known statistical property of diluting a single extreme p-value across a k=49-test panel, not an implementation defect (dual-path control exact on both cells).",
